  "title": "Mediterranean Salmon Foil Packets",
  "description": "These salmon foil packets with tomatoes, herbs, and black olives are quick and easy to make on the grill for a delicious salmon dinner in the summer.",
  "authors": [
    "Paola Albanesi"
  ],
